{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Garden of Aiden",
    "steam_appid": 2525150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525150/extras/c9f164481253a2bfb642a8bdeadac4b8.avif?t=1752289383\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, single\u2011player metroidvania built for players who crave precision movement, compact storytelling, and rewarding secrets. Every screen is hand\u2011crafted; every death teaches; every secret discovered feels earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Physics Platforming</strong> \u2013 responsive jump, air\u2011dash, wall\u2011jump, and staff combat mechanics designed for tight control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Metroidvania Design</strong> \u2013 explore a sprawling techno-organic world with twisting pathways; unlock hidden shortcuts, ride Neura-lifts, and branch off into secret routes that seamlessly weave back into your main journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Arsenal</strong> \u2013 absorb GAIA's Neura mana to gain traversal and combat upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitchspawn Showdowns</strong> \u2013 corrupted guardians whose attack patterns mutate as the corruption spreads; learn, adapt, overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Memory Shards</strong> \u2013 collect data fragments that piece together the world and the creation of GAIA.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Synth\u2011Organic Score</strong> \u2013 a dynamic soundtrack that shifts from serene ambience in healthy boughs to distorted pulses in corrupted zones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore GAIA's core and heal the world before corruption claims every last pixel of Neura Eden?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525150/extras/c9f164481253a2bfb642a8bdeadac4b8.avif?t=1752289383\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, single\u2011player metroidvania built for players who crave precision movement, compact storytelling, and rewarding secrets. Every screen is hand\u2011crafted; every death teaches; every secret discovered feels earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Physics Platforming</strong> \u2013 responsive jump, air\u2011dash, wall\u2011jump, and staff combat mechanics designed for tight control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Metroidvania Design</strong> \u2013 explore a sprawling techno-organic world with twisting pathways; unlock hidden shortcuts, ride Neura-lifts, and branch off into secret routes that seamlessly weave back into your main journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Arsenal</strong> \u2013 absorb GAIA's Neura mana to gain traversal and combat upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitchspawn Showdowns</strong> \u2013 corrupted guardians whose attack patterns mutate as the corruption spreads; learn, adapt, overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Memory Shards</strong> \u2013 collect data fragments that piece together the world and the creation of GAIA.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Synth\u2011Organic Score</strong> \u2013 a dynamic soundtrack that shifts from serene ambience in healthy boughs to distorted pulses in corrupted zones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore GAIA's core and heal the world before corruption claims every last pixel of Neura Eden?</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a living world governed by a planetary AI, now overrun by a corrupting force known as the Glitchspawn. In Garden of Aiden, you'll leap with precision, wield your staff, and rewrite nature itself as you ascend through the interconnected pathways of this towering metroidvania.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
